---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About Gil Gatson | Geopolitical Strategy & AI Geopolitics Expert"
  description="Learn about Gil Gatson, a leading geopolitical strategist and AI author specializing in AI geopolitics, semiconductor strategy, and industrial policy."
>
  <div class="container">
    <article class="about-content">
      <h1>About Gil Gatson</h1>
      
      <p class="intro">
        Entrepreneur obsessed with tech, geopolitics & winning the industrial future.<br>
        Semicon wars. AI dominance. No time for cope.
      </p>
      
      <section>
        <h2>Background</h2>
        <p>
          Gil Gatson is a geopolitical strategist, entrepreneur, and author who specializes in analyzing the intersection of technology, industrial policy, and global competition. His work focuses on the critical challenges facing America in the US-China tech war, particularly in semiconductors, artificial intelligence, and advanced manufacturing.
        </p>
        <p>
          With a background spanning business strategy, technology analysis, and entrepreneurship, Gil brings a unique perspective to the most pressing questions of our time: Can America maintain its technological edge? What are the real bottlenecks in the AI race? How do semiconductor supply chains shape geopolitical power?
        </p>
        <p>
          His analysis cuts through the noise of conventional wisdom and political rhetoric to examine the material realities that determine technological leadership: energy infrastructure, manufacturing capacity, supply chain resilience, and industrial policy. He is known for his contrarian takes on AI dominance, export controls, and the strategic vulnerabilities in America's tech ecosystem.
        </p>
        <p>
          Through his writing, consulting, and speaking engagements, Gil helps investors, policymakers, and business leaders understand the forces shaping the future of global technology competition. His work has been read by executives at Fortune 500 companies, policy analysts in Washington, and investors managing billions in tech-focused portfolios.
        </p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>Areas of Expertise</h2>
        <ul class="expertise-list">
          <li><strong>Technology & Geopolitics:</strong> Analysis of global technology competition, particularly the US-China AI race</li>
          <li><strong>Industrial Policy:</strong> Strategic frameworks for manufacturing, energy, and supply chain resilience</li>
          <li><strong>Business Strategy:</strong> Helping organizations build competitive advantages in rapidly changing markets</li>
          <li><strong>Entrepreneurship:</strong> Practical guidance for building and scaling online businesses</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>Published Works</h2>
        <p>
          Gil is the author of <strong>THE AI DELUSION: The Brutal Truth About America's AI Future</strong>, 
          a critical examination of America's position in the global AI race. The book challenges the prevailing narrative of American AI dominance 
          and presents a strategic roadmap for maintaining technological leadership.
        </p>
        <p>
          He is also the creator of the <strong>Side Hustle Launchpad Series</strong>, practical guides that help aspiring entrepreneurs 
          build profitable online businesses on platforms like TikTok Shop, Amazon KDP, and Etsy.
        </p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
        <p>
          <a href="https://www.amazon.com/author/gilgatson" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon Author Page</a> | 
          For speaking engagements, consulting inquiries, or media requests, please visit the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>

  <style>
    .about-content {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    
    h1 {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    
    .intro {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      padding: 2rem;
      background: #f9fafb;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    
    .lead {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }
    
    section {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    
    h2 {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
    }
    
    p {
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    
    .expertise-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
    }
    
    .expertise-list li {
      padding: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      background: #f9fafb;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    
    .expertise-list strong {
      color: var(--color-accent);
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
